{"strings":["AIP","Details related to the Additional Information Package (AIP) to be used for exchange of response or intergovernmental information, if needed in combination with Base Information Package (BIP) Declaration or LPCO.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Functional identifier","Identification of a specific information exchange.","Document reference number, assigned by the Trader","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Language code","Code specifying the language used or requested.","LanguageCodeList","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Version identifier","Identification of the version of a specific document/message number.","Reply type code","Code specifying the type of reply required or transmitted.","UN/EDIFACT code list 4343 OR User code list","Authenticator","Details related to an authenticating party.","Authenticator name","Name of the party which certifies that a document is authentic.","Authenticator identifier","Identification of a party which certifies that a document is authentic.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Identification issuing country code","Code specifying the issuing country of the identification.","CountryCodeList","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-e